Task 3: Check available memory
ansible -i inventory.ini linux_servers -m command -a "free -h" --ask-pass

Task 4: Check disk usage
ansible -i inventory.ini linux_servers -m command -a "df -h" --ask-pass

These commands demonstrate a key benefit of Ansible: you can execute one command on multiple servers without logging into each server manually.